2. Project Workflow
Text
The system follows these steps:
User Input → Document Upload → Text Extraction → NLP Processing → AI Model → Legal Analysis → Result Generation → User Interface
Sample Coding
def legal_document_workflow(document):
    text = extract_text(document)
    processed_text = preprocess(text)
    result = analyze_document(processed_text)
    return result

def extract_text(document):
    return document

def preprocess(text):
    return text.lower()

def analyze_document(text):
    return {
        "status": "Analysis completed",
        "text": text
    }

document = "Sample legal document"
print(legal_document_workflow(document))
